      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organizational Page Credibility",
      "Anchor": "organizational-page-credibility",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The Organizational Page Credibility API provides APIs to retrieve Page Credibilities, which are admin-specified highlights of the page.\nThis Credibility shows up in various surfaces on LinkedIn, such as on the top card, in the search card entity, etc.\nThe first Page Credibility is considered the \u0022highlighted\u0022, or most prominent Credibility to display.",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
      "Kind": "text",
      "Section": "Organizational Page Credibility",
      "Anchor": "organizational-page-credibility",
      "SectionPath": [],
      "Text": "The service provides the following methods:",
      "Headers": [],
      "Rows": []
    },
    {
